  "rationale": "v2 Entity.entity_id is now bytes. At construction (C004), the string identifier must be UTF-8 encoded to bytes. At observation (C002), bytes must be UTF-8 decoded back to string. v1 behavior unchanged since it remains string type. The output observation key 'entity_id' retains string value as specified.",
